  14:     - Foreground pixels may or may not have a matching foreground pixel in the reflected row at the same column.
  15: 
  16:     Rule:
  17:     - Preserve black background pixels.
  18:     - Recolor a foreground pixel red if the pixel at the same column in the opposite row is also foreground.
  19:     - Recolor every other foreground pixel grey.
  20: 
  21:     Key insight:
  22:     - The red pixels are the horizontally symmetric intersection of the foreground mask with its top-bottom reflection.
